                  title:
                    "5757 S. University Ave. Chicago, IL 60637 Main: 773.702.5599 bfi.uchicago.edu",
                  snippet:
                    "Bloom, N., Han, R., &amp; Liang, J. (2024). Hybrid working from home works improves retention · without damaging productivity. Nature 630, 920-925, June 2024. Bloom, N., Dahl, G., &amp; Roth, D.-O. (2025).\n(2025) show that WFH uptake in Europe has · been highly uneven, with the highest increases occurring in cities and capital regions. The next section discusses the context of our study. Section 3 presents the recruitment results, Section 4 examines the productivity effects and Section 5 concludes.\nWORKING PAPER · NO. 2025-68\nAgrawal, D. B., & Brueckner, J. K. (2025).\nLuca, D., Özgüzel, C., & Wei, Z. (2025).",
